# Canonicalizes git author emails so `git log --format=%aE` (mailmap-resolved, capital E —
# not %ae, which is raw and ignores this file) agrees with users.email. The relevance collector
# must read author emails this way, or a mismatch here silently drops that person from every
# score (types.ts, "UNOWNED" section).
#
# Format: Proper Name <canonical@email> <email-seen-in-a-commit>
# One confirmed entry below; two are placeholders until the real account emails are known —
# see the message to the team about filling them in.

